# Pairs with LastAdminGuard. A group deletion that removes its admin entry
# through a plain put, so it races an access-facade removal unguarded.
MODULE: GroupDeleteCommitsUnguarded
TARGET: LastAdminGuard
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the group deletion's admin-entry removal skips the guarded commit
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
       /\ IF "admin" \in op.sets /\ AdmissibleCount(merged["admin"]) = 0
--- REPLACE
       /\ IF "admin" \in op.sets /\ op.kind # "deleteGroup" /\ AdmissibleCount(merged["admin"]) = 0
--- END